{"id": "sketch-a-violin-glowing", "title": "Glowing violin", "blurb": "", "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 100 100' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'>\n  <!-- Glow aura -->\n  <ellipse cx='50' cy='52' rx='30' ry='40' fill='#FFD700' opacity='0.12'/>\n  <ellipse cx='50' cy='52' rx='22' ry='32' fill='#FFD700' opacity='0.18'/>\n\n  <!-- Violin body outline (warm amber wood) -->\n  <path d='M50 20 C40 20 35 28 34 36 C33 42 36 46 36 50 C36 56 30 60 30 68 C30 78 38 84 50 84 C62 84 70 78 70 68 C70 60 64 56 64 50 C64 46 67 42 66 36 C65 28 60 20 50 20Z' fill='#E8A020'/>\n\n  <!-- Body face lighter amber -->\n  <path d='M50 23 C41.5 23 37 30 36.2 37 C35.4 43 38 47 38 50.5 C38 56 32.5 60 32.5 67.5 C32.5 76 39.5 81 50 81 C60.5 81 67.5 76 67.5 67.5 C67.5 60 62 56 62 50.5 C62 47 64.6 43 63.8 37 C63 30 58.5 23 50 23Z' fill='#F5C040'/>\n\n  <!-- Inner body highlight -->\n  <path d='M50 28 C43 28 39.5 34 39 39 C38.5 44 41 47.5 41 50.5 C41 55 36.5 58.5 36.5 66 C36.5 73.5 42.5 77.5 50 77.5 C57.5 77.5 63.5 73.5 63.5 66 C63.5 58.5 59 55 59 50.5 C59 47.5 61.5 44 61 39 C60.5 34 57 28 50 28Z' fill='#FAD96A'/>\n\n  <!-- F-holes (bright contrasting glow) -->\n  <path d='M41 52 C40 56 40 60 41.5 63 C42.5 64.5 41 65 40 64 C38.5 62 39 57 39.5 53 C40 51 41 51 41 52Z' fill='#FF8C00'/>\n  <path d='M59 52 C60 56 60 60 58.5 63 C57.5 64.5 59 65 60 64 C61.5 62 61 57 60.5 53 C60 51 59 51 59 52Z' fill='#FF8C00'/>\n\n  <!-- Fingerboard (dark purple-brown) -->\n  <rect x='46' y='10' width='8' height='42' rx='3' fill='#4B2A6B'/>\n\n  <!-- Strings (bright golden lines) -->\n  <line x1='48' y1='14' x2='48' y2='78' stroke='#FFE060' stroke-width='1'/>\n  <line x1='50' y1='12' x2='50' y2='80' stroke='#FFE060' stroke-width='1.2'/>\n  <line x1='52' y1='14' x2='52' y2='78' stroke='#FFE060' stroke-width='1'/>\n\n  <!-- Bridge (light cream) -->\n  <path d='M42 68 L44 64 L56 64 L58 68 Z' fill='#FFF0B0'/>\n  <rect x='43' y='68' width='14' height='2' rx='1' fill='#FFF0B0'/>\n\n  <!-- Tailpiece (dark purple) -->\n  <path d='M44 72 L56 72 L54.5 82 L45.5 82 Z' fill='#6B3F9E'/>\n\n  <!-- Chinrest (green-gold) -->\n  <path d='M38 78 C36 80 38 84 44 84 L46 82 L43 76 Z' fill='#8BBD30'/>\n\n  <!-- Tuning pegs (light grey) -->\n  <rect x='42' y='12' width='3' height='2.5' rx='1' fill='#D8D8F0'/>\n  <rect x='55' y='12' width='3' height='2.5' rx='1' fill='#D8D8F0'/>\n  <rect x='42' y='18' width='3' height='2.5' rx='1' fill='#D8D8F0'/>\n  <rect x='55' y='18' width='3' height='2.5' rx='1' fill='#D8D8F0'/>\n\n  <!-- Scroll / pegbox at top (warm wood) -->\n  <path d='M46 10 C46 6 48 4 50 4 C52 4 54 6 54 10 C54 13 52 15 50 15 C48 15 46 13 46 10Z' fill='#E8A020'/>\n  <path d='M47.5 10 C47.5 7.5 48.5 6 50 6 C51.5 6 52.5 7.5 52.5 10 C52.5 12 51.5 13.5 50 13.5 C48.5 13.5 47.5 12 47.5 10Z' fill='#F5C040'/>\n\n  <!-- Bow (diagonal, golden with white hair) -->\n  <line x1='20' y1='88' x2='72' y2='30' stroke='#C88A20' stroke-width='2.5' stroke-linecap='round'/>\n  <line x1='23' y1='85' x2='69' y2='33' stroke='#FFF8D0' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-linecap='round'/>\n  <!-- Bow tip -->\n  <circle cx='72' cy='30' r='2.5' fill='#FFE060'/>\n  <!-- Bow frog -->\n  <rect x='18' y='86' width='5' height='4' rx='1.5' fill='#8B4513' transform='rotate(-45 20 88)'/>\n\n  <!-- Sparkles around violin -->\n  <circle cx='25' cy='35' r='1.5' fill='#FFFFA0'/>\n  <circle cx='75' cy='40' r='1.2' fill='#FFFFA0'/>\n  <circle cx='30' cy='55' r='1' fill='#FFFFA0'/>\n  <circle cx='72' cy='60' r='1.3' fill='#FFFFA0'/>\n  <circle cx='22' cy='72' r='1' fill='#FFFFA0'/>\n  <circle cx='80' cy='25' r='1' fill='#FFFFA0'/>\n  <circle cx='65' cy='90' r='1.2' fill='#FFFFA0'/>\n</svg>", "tags": ["violin", "glowing", "music"]}